  "description": {
   "value": "<p><em>Prerequisite: Must have Cursed Wave</em></p>\n<p>While you have your Regalia manifested, you can spend 3 CE as a bonus action to summon a hagoromo scarf around your body that lasts until your Regalia disappears. As a reaction, you can add your proficiency bonus to your AC until the beginning of your next turn, or to a saving throw you make as the silken scarf protects you from harm.</p>",
